    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">Is there really no design deposit? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, really. Most agencies ask for $3,000–$5,000 before they write a line of code. We don't. Your first $175 kicks off the build and the price never moves.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">Why the 12-month minimum on the monthly plan? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">Because we're doing a full custom build with nothing up front. The 12-month term is how the math works for us. After year one it's month-to-month with 30 days' notice to cancel.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">What if I cancel early? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">The remaining months are due under the agreement. We don't enjoy early-cancel situations, so we'll usually find a reasonable way forward, but the written agreement is what governs.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">Can I move from monthly to owning the code later? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes. If you'd rather own the code outright at some point, we'll quote a buyout. It's a straightforward conversation. No penalty for asking.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">Do I own my domain? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">Always. Your domain stays registered in your name; we just point its DNS at our hosting. If you ever move on, the domain goes with you.</div></div>
